<main id="main" class="form-page"><div class="form-story"><h1>Tem alguém<br>na escuta?</h1><p>Envie sua mensagem. Mesmo entre dois mundos, a gente encontra um jeito de se conectar.</p><img class="lamps" src="<?= e(img('backgrounds/lamps.png')) ?>" alt="Luzes coloridas sobre o alfabeto"></div><section class="form-panel"><h2>Faça contato.</h2><p>Preencha os campos abaixo.</p><form action="<?= e(url('contact_send')) ?>" method="post" class="stack-form"><?php csrf_field() ?><label for="name">Nome<input id="name" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" value="<?= e($old['name']??$viewer['name']??'') ?>"></label><label for="email">E-mail<input id="email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="email" value="<?= e($old['email']??$viewer['email']??'') ?>"></label><label for="subject">Assunto <span class="muted">(opcional)</span><input id="subject" name="subject" maxlength="150" value="<?= e($old['subject']??'') ?>"></label><label for="message">Mensagem<textarea id="message" name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" rows="5"><?= e($old['message']??'') ?></textarea></label><button class="button red">Enviar mensagem <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></span></button></form></section></main>
